  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed first floor side extension, by virtue of its isolated roof form and lack of physical or visual integration with the main roof of the dwelling, would result in an incongruous and fragmented addition. The mismatched roof pitch would appear out of character with the host building and the wider street scene. The proposal is therefore contrary to Policy 28 of the Sutton Local Plan (2018) and the design principles set out in the 'Design of Residential Extensions' Supplementary Planning Document (SPD4), which require extensions to be high-quality, sympathetic, and visually integrated with the original building."
  ],
